# Tapping Install says Installing at once, and on a call it ends the call first: scripts/duo tap <ref> scripts/duo-update-taps
launch hexvoice:///?tasks&update=demo
wait 3
shoot ready-in-tasks
tap update-install
wait 1
shoot installing-in-tasks
launch hexvoice:///?demo=call&update=demo
wait 4
shoot ready-on-call
tap update-install
wait 2
shoot installing-call-ended
